{
  "name": "cpartner-association",
  "description": "Partner and funder associations (prds/partner-association-plan.md; Doug's rulings 10-28-26): one record per tie between a partner or funder and a company, or a person or lead with no company yet — the partner referred them to CBM, they attended the partner's or funder's event, or a mentor referred them to the partner. Never deleted by the application. Plus CEventRegistration.registrationCompany: the company the person was with when they registered. Additive only; nothing Read-only (the application writes every field under the org-wide API key). Handoff: partner-association-crm-handoff.md.",
